        {
          "id": "e111a602-af80-4c61-b409-cbc560e593d5",
          "name": "Get Clinician Documents",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get Clinician Documents",
            "description": {
              "content": "<h3>General Information</h3>\n<p>This endpoint allows facilities to retrieve a list of all documents associated with a specific clinician.</p>\n<h4><strong>Required Parameters</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>clinicianId</strong> (path parameter): The unique identifier of the clinician</li>\n<li><strong>shiftId</strong> (query parameter): The shift ID which the clinician requested</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>Document Categories</strong></h4>\n<p>The endpoint returns documents organized by the following categories:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LICENSE</strong>: Professional licenses (nursing, medical, etc.)</li>\n<li><strong>CREDENTIAL</strong>: Professional credentials and certifications</li>\n<li><strong>BACKGROUND_CHECK</strong>: Background check documents and results</li>\n<li><strong>SSN</strong>: Social Security Number verification documents</li>\n<li><strong>CDPH_530</strong>: California Department of Public Health 530 forms</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>Access Control</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>The implementation logic requires that a clinician has submitted a shift request to a facility that the facility user is connected to. This requirement is in place to prevent the unauthorized sharing of documentation for users who have not interacted with one of your shifts.</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v2",
                "public",
                "clinicians",
                ":clinicianId",
                "documents"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "shiftId",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Id of the shift"
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "clinicianId",
                  "description": "(Required) Clinician ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{bearerToken}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
